 - the stubs nterp calls: aput_obj, lock/unlock (fast and slow paths, also the JNI ones), check_instance_of,
   invoke_polymorphic, the array size computation of the allocation stubs, and the rosalloc fast path, whose free
   slot's 64-bit next pointer overlaps the new object's lock word (the class store clears it with stp);
 - C++: ArtMethod::Invoke decodes a reference result (nterp and compiled code return the offset in w0),
   nterp's filled-new-array, StackVisitor's references and the deoptimization's.
